flowchart TD
  P[Existing physical presence and eligibility] --> S[ObjectiveService settle]
  T[Existing timed control boundary] --> S
  S --> C{Owner or state changed?}
  C -->|Yes| L[Replace one latest_change fact on this objective]
  C -->|No| I[Keep prior fact; no duplicate]
  T --> A[Existing advance_to credits eligible Resource income]
  A --> R[Receiving requisition authority]
  S --> O[Current control / owner / state authority]
  O --> Q[Detached selected-objective inspect]
  L --> Q
  I --> Q
  A --> Q
  Q --> F[Read-only feedback: current state, rate, earned, latest change]
  F --> E[Contest ended says nothing about which side remains]
  E --> V[Existing deferred BattlefieldView inspector refresh]
  B[Bind replacement simulation] --> Q
  N[No new command / timer / polling / history log] -. contract .-> V
